        "original_id": "3169909e-8df6-53db-b68d-6b59d4ef647c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Max Green, Brent Ashley, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Bands: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers, Combichrist\n\nFacts:\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001 and primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and Chantal Claret is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Maxwell Scott Green was born on December 15, 1984, and Max Green is an American musician.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate and served as its bassist and backing vocalist.\n- Max Green was also the former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.\n- Brent Ashley is the current bassist for Combichrist.\n- Brent Ashley is the former bassist for The Natural Born Killers featuring Max Green of Escape the Fate.",
